[[Thieving]] training on an ironman is not very different from training it [[Thieving training|normally]]. Certain methods, such as [[pickpocketing]] [[Master Farmers]], are favoured due to their valuable drops.

==Early training: Quests==
{{Main|Quest experience rewards#Thieving}}
Early levels can be skipped by completing quests rewarding Thieving experience. Notably, [[Hazeel Cult]] has no requirements, one path involves no combat, and grants 1,500 Thieving experience. [[Fight Arena]] also has no requirements, the monsters can be [[safespot]]ted, and it rewards 2,175 Thieving experience. Completing both will reach level 18 Thieving from level 1.
